  "name": "Carrot and Pineapple Cake",
  "subtitle": "A moist spiced cake with tangy cream-cheese frosting",
  "description": "Grated carrot and pineapple add moisture and texture to this warmly spiced cake, finished with a smooth vanilla frosting.",
